From: claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 21:50:46 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] Audit fixes: safe FTS search, idempotent indexing, honest
 engine, escaped HTML

- Index: tokenize/quote queries (punctuation crashed FTS5), replace chunks on
  re-index (were duplicated), close connections, clamp limit, return provenance
- Chunker: stop at end of text; validate size/overlap
- Engine: no invented truth_status, structured provider errors, source-bearing
  evidence, honest offline messages, wired to LocalIndex via make_archive_search
- HTML UI: escape query and document text
- Tests: 7 -> 41; README states what acquisition really does

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DgowgDUMjUCuK2PAWwLLXN
